WEBVTT

00:03:27.662 --> 00:03:30.539
your body is really good
at maintaining hydration.

00:03:30.581 --> 00:03:33.918
But if you stop counting
eight glasses of water a day,

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.670
how much should you be drinking?

00:03:35.711 --> 00:03:37.129
The answer is simple:

00:03:37.171 --> 00:03:39.340
there is no should.

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:41.842
When you feel thirsty, drink some water.

00:03:41.884 --> 00:03:43.970
You can trust your body.

00:03:44.011 --> 00:03:46.847
Unless you have kidney stones
or are elderly --

00:03:46.847 --> 00:03:50.059
sometimes, our messaging systems
get a little worn with age --

00:03:50.101 --> 00:03:52.353
or your doctor has told you otherwise,

00:03:52.395 --> 00:03:55.523
constantly monitoring
how much water you drink

00:03:55.523 --> 00:03:57.358
is not really necessary.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.568
Here's a point that's often missed:

00:03:59.568 --> 00:04:02.655
every single thing you consume
contains water.